  "question": "Two planets $P_1$ and $P_2$ with equal mass have radii $R_1$ and $R_2$, respectively, where $R_2 = \\dfrac{R_1}{2}$. The escape speeds of $P_1$ and $P_2$ are $v_1$ and $v_2$, respectively. Then $\\dfrac{v_2}{v_1}$ is :",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$1$",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\sqrt{2}$",
      "image": ""
    },
