  "answer": "C",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$v_e = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{2GM}{R}}$, so for equal masses $v_e \\propto \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{R}}$.\n\n$$\\frac{v_2}{v_1} = \\sqrt{\\frac{R_1}{R_2}} = \\sqrt{2}$$",
